\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{What a retained-context comparison can identify}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{evaluation}

\p{With matched weights, prompt law, decoding, budget, estimator, and
evaluation interface, a comparison can identify a conditional contrast between
retained-context policies. Without those controls it identifies only the joint
cell, not a causal effect of context alone.}
